{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000001187","bookName":"La luz que nunca se apaga","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000001187/42000001187.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":525154,"followCount":13111,"introduction":"Hace ocho años, Claudia López estuvo al borde de la muerte en un parto. Martín Serrano le donó un riñón y desapareció llevándose a su hija. Ocho años después, Claudia regresa sin conocer la verdad y cree que Nidia es hija de su esposo con otra mujer. Su madre sospecha y hace una prueba de paternidad. Entre malentendidos y obstáculos del proyecto, Nidia arriesga su vida para proteger su hogar, hasta que la prueba confirma la relación madre-hija y Claudia corre a rescatarla.","chapterCount":74,"labels":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"tags":["Family Bonds","Strong Female Lead"],"typeTwoIds":[703],"typeTwoNames":["Familia"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":703,"name":"Familia","replaceName":"familia"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Familia","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-luz-que-nunca-se-apaga","bookNameLower":"la-luz-que-nunca-se-apaga","shelfTime":"2025-12-10 17:33:58","firstShelfTime":"2025-12-10 17:33:58","performerList":[{"performerId":"19939","performerName":"Yuetao Liu","performerFormatName":"Yuetao-Liu","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x3/19939/19939.jpg?time=1792661358083","videoCount":1},{"performerId":"20219","performerName":"Zhang Zhang","performerFormatName":"Zhang-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/9x1/20219/20219.jpg?time=1787565109623","videoCount":3}],"performerIdList":[19939,20219]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700074555","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/55/7x8/78x1/781x1/78110000024/700074555_1/700074555.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795215600&Signature=xPcAy5NIetkKmuQKLZwYaYqxDOmh2rDY261ETbTQQ0jB3Hs5oGl6pMiZKqVdNLkSnE65mrHkJYnZt4JNx3Ews2nByinthDsO2oc~P1nZYElAQ50C92-KWDYARR~EIFjiuDOc0KN37oRnUoy6bfiuZcLj